This plugin uses DeepSeek Harness's native session and compaction services.
Compaction algorithms and pretrained embedding models are credited to their
original authors, not claimed as original work by this project.

The historical prototype used wpc0323/deepseek-web-import (MIT),
LingSuiYA/deepseek-web-import-f (MIT), and MemTensor/MemOS with the
cnlove7777777-art/dsh-memos-compat fork (upstream Apache-2.0; fork modifications
described as MIT). These historical vendor implementations are not shipped.

The full installer includes the original publisher's multilingual MiniLM ONNX
model under Apache-2.0, with its model card, license and exact provenance under
plugin/notices/model/. File bytes are unchanged; the ONNX file is renamed for
the local loader. Model assets are excluded from Git and the source zip.

